# Share document semantics

## Requirement

Prefer shared definitions of format interpretation, validation and rendering across editor integrations when technically feasible.

## Traceability

- `inputs/externals/objectives.md` · Specific objectives 7
- `inputs/externals/definitions.md` · 5. Common behavior and host adapters

## Verification

Verify the stated behavior through a focused acceptance test or documented inspection. Detailed test cases will be defined during design.
